msgid "Helpful out of the box"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[4]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Fedora Workstation includes a great set of utilities, like Clocks, Weather "
"and Maps."
